+// micro-sequencer RAM at 0x05000000, the IPL ROM at 0x06000000, the drive (seek, read, write,
+// motor), the real-time clock, and its interrupt, the cartridge line (COP0 Cause IP3).
+//
+// Ported from ares (ISC), n64/dd/*, by LuigiBlood and the ares team (dd.cpp, controller.cpp,
+// drive.cpp, io.cpp, rtc.cpp, serialization.cpp; the CIC models of n64/cic/cic.cpp).
