+//
+// Nothing here runs unless a 64DD IPL is given (attach): without one the address ranges stay
+// unmapped (open bus) and no event is scheduled, as before.
+//
+// Timing: ares' scheduler counts two clocks per VR4300 cycle (93.75 MHz x 2); Gopher64's events
+// count VR4300 cycles, so ares' counts are halved (ares_clocks). Durations ares gives in seconds
+// (the clock's tick, the motor's standby and sleep delays) follow Gopher64's clock rate.
+
+pub mod disk;
